{"task_id": "HumanEval/82", "solution": "```python\ndef prime_length(string):\n    \"\"\"Checks if the length of the input string is a prime number.\"\"\"\n    def is_prime(n):\n        if n <= 1:\n            return False\n        if n <= 3:\n            return True\n        if n % 2 == 0 or n % 3 == 0:\n            return False\n        i = 5\n        while i * i <= n:\n            if n % i == 0 or n % (i + 2) == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 6\n        return True\n\n    length = len(string)\n    return is_prime(length)\n```"}
